
---

## 📄 `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# =========================
# Python
# =========================
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
*.egg

# =========================
# Virtual environments
# =========================
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.python-version

# =========================
# Environment / secrets
# =========================
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
secrets.json

# =========================
# uv
# =========================
# Keep uv.lock committed for reproducible builds.
# Uncomment the line below if you prefer to ignore it.
# uv.lock

# =========================
# IDE / editors
# =========================
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store

# =========================
# Testing / coverage
# =========================
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# =========================
# Logs and local data
# =========================
*.log
logs/
*.sqlite
*.db
.cache/

# =========================
# OS junk
# =========================
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini